{"unit_id":"Funny1Potato__dsh-outsourcing-expert#card-zh","repo":"Funny1Potato/dsh-outsourcing-expert","commit":"2cf20c31d018a21ea25fb023acd88caabc7dc718","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outsourcing-expert（DSH 插件，适用于使用相应 agent preset 的客户端）：为 DSH 提供外包高手与领导模式，让顶层 agent 按子智能体模型能力分派工作。插件接入工具执行前置钩子和系统提示段，在外包模式拦截领导的工作工具，并要求先侦察可用模型、依据能力表和任务难度委派；反向 preset 则刻意挑选较不适合任务的模型。它还提供能力表本地缓存、委派失败后升级重试提示，以及查看、清除和重新侦察缓存的命令。适合希望把任务交给多个子智能体或试验不同选模策略的 DSH 用户。使用前需在宿主配置子智能体及其可用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:836-850","src/index.js:1007-1064","src/index.js:1134-1204"]}
{"unit_id":"Funny1Potato__dsh-outsourcing-expert#card-en","repo":"Funny1Potato/dsh-outsourcing-expert","commit":"2cf20c31d018a21ea25fb023acd88caabc7dc718","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-outsourcing-expert adds DSH presets for subagent delegation. Outsourcing mode blocks work tools and guides model selection; reverse mode chooses a less suitable model, while leader mode keeps work tools available. It caches model capabilities and provides cache management commands.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:836-850","src/index.js:1007-1064","src/index.js:1134-1204"]}
