{"unit_id":"Funny1Potato__dsh-outsourcing-expert#feature-1","repo":"Funny1Potato/dsh-outsourcing-expert","commit":"2cf20c31d018a21ea25fb023acd88caabc7dc718","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outsourcing-expert 的功能「按规则委派」：外包模式通过工具执行前置钩子拦截领导的非管理工具，允许委派与规划类工具，并由提示段指导按任务类型和难度选择子智能体。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:836-846","src/index.js:1007-1064"]}
