{"unit_id":"Funny1Potato__dsh-outsourcing-expert#feature-3","repo":"Funny1Potato/dsh-outsourcing-expert","commit":"2cf20c31d018a21ea25fb023acd88caabc7dc718","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outsourcing-expert 的功能「管理能力表」：提供查看缓存、清除缓存和清除后重新侦察的命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1166-1220"]}
{"unit_id":"Funny1Potato__dsh-outsourcing-expert#feature-4","repo":"Funny1Potato/dsh-outsourcing-expert","commit":"2cf20c31d018a21ea25fb023acd88caabc7dc718","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outsourcing-expert 的功能「多种选模 preset」：preset 可配置正常能力匹配、反向选择不适合任务的模型，或 leader 模式；leader 模式保留执行工具，仅注入能力表。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:785-787","src/index.js:836-846"]}
